                                "sense_id": "23071002-5e21-327c-96f5-af1180cf4f72",
                                "text": "[…] picturals / Of Magistrates, of courts, of tribunals, / Of commen wealthes, of states, of pollicy, / Of lawes, of iudgements, and of decretals […]"
                            }
                        ]
